<h1 class="title">{% if title %}{{ title }}{% endif %} ({{ year }})</h1>
<div class="project__info">
  <div class="project__info-L">
    <p>
      I joined as a graphic designer for Seattle University's Wellness and
      Health Promotion office in June 2024, developing the brand identity for
      their food pantry. During the summer of 2024, I observed and participated
      in pantry operations while designing the logo.
    </p>
    <p>
      My goal in designing the logo for the food pantry was to create an
      inclusive identity that could stand alone as its own university
      department, reflecting the pantry's growth and its need for a dedicated
      space on campus. I considered both the university audience and the
      potential for future expansion.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="project__info-R">
    <h3>Roles:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Creative Direction</li>
      <li>Brand Identity</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
