<p>
  Yippe Sketches! These represent my early explorations for the Wellness Cafe
  Food Pantry logo. Some were created later in the process, especially after
  encountering creative blocks. Experimenting with acrylic markers allowed me to
  visualize how vibrant colors might enhance the brand’s identity. Through these
  sketches, I explored different icons and visual motifs, searching for a symbol
  or set of icons that truly resonated with the pantry’s mission and
  personality.
</p>
<h2>Progress</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p>
    In the early stages, I explored visual directions to test different
    typographic and color treatments. While these drafts lacked refinement, they
    helped identify what resonated with the brand's tone. These intentionally
    unpolished concepts allowed me to experiment with visual hierarchy and brand
    personality.
  </p>
