<p>
  Typography was a bit challenging, as I wasn't sure what feeling was most
  appropriate. I initially chose a typeface with a distressed look, but this
  became an issue when considering mass production and branding. This led me to
  select a clean and easy-to-read typeface.
</p>
<img
  src="/assets/img/projects/Wellness Cafe Food Pantry/Draft---Typography-Finalization.jpg"
