<p>
  Composition proved challenging because I wanted to incorporate many elements,
  which made it difficult to settle on a clear direction. I found myself needing
  to simplify my ideas to avoid overwhelming the design. Through this process, I
  learned the importance of prioritizing key visual components and creating a
  balanced layout that communicates the brand’s message effectively.
</p>
